== Branch/hinge/branch accessor <app:ao-field-fractal-properties:accessor>

Use the branch-order object #eqref("eq:ao-kernel"), its cardinality accessor
#eqref("eq:ao-rd-accessor-kernel"), and the hypotheses of
#eqref("eq:single-hinge-symmetric-fixture").
Under the declared single-hinge neutral-reflection field-property reduction,
$rho^D = R D_(AO)$. A compatible native count window then supplies
#eqref("eq:window-clipped-rho"), channel pressure
#eqref("eq:b-scoped-channel-pressure"), and pending burden
#eqref("eq:burden-overhang"). These are scalar accessors of
$C_f [M]_(AO)$, with no change to its certified object.



